WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.885
Jack climbed down the beanstalk.

2
00:00:06.886 --> 00:00:19.585
He climbed and climbed and climbed.

3
00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:23.166
At last Jack stepped onto the ground.

4
00:00:23.167 --> 00:00:26.740
"Whew! I made it!" he thought.

5
00:00:26.741 --> 00:00:32.475
Quickly he ran inside.

6
00:00:32.476 --> 00:00:38.110
"Mother!" Jack cried. "Look!"

7
00:00:38.111 --> 00:00:44.562
Mother gasped. "Is that gold—real gold?"

8
00:00:44.563 --> 00:00:50.795
"Yes, it's gold the ogre stole from us!" Jack said.

9
00:00:50.796 --> 00:01:03.356
He took her outside to see the beanstalk.

10
00:01:03.357 --> 00:01:07.268
"I told you those were magic beans," Jack said.

11
00:01:07.269 --> 00:01:10.088
"We got some of our gold back!"

12
00:01:10.089 --> 00:01:12.286
Mother hugged Jack.

13
00:01:12.287 --> 00:01:22.791
"You were right," she said. "Oh, how wonderful!"

14
00:01:22.792 --> 00:01:29.490
That night Jack and Mother ate a big dinner.

15
00:01:29.491 --> 00:01:40.750
And for a long time, they felt rich and happy.

16
00:01:40.751 --> 00:01:43.927
But Jack knew there was a problem.

17
00:01:43.928 --> 00:01:48.110
Each month the bag became a little less full.

18
00:01:48.111 --> 00:01:52.830
"One day the coins will be gone," Jack thought.

19
00:01:52.831 --> 00:01:59.464
So Jack made a new grand plan.

20
00:01:59.465 --> 00:02:07.634
One morning he woke up early.

21
00:02:07.635 --> 00:02:10.711
He jumped onto the beanstalk.

22
00:02:10.712 --> 00:02:15.223
Up, up, up, he climbed.

23
00:02:15.224 --> 00:02:21.687
At last Jack reached the land above the clouds.

24
00:02:21.688 --> 00:02:25.969
He walked, following the road.

25
00:02:25.970 --> 00:02:30.773
Soon he came to the ogre's tall house.

26
00:02:30.774 --> 00:02:33.757
Once more he saw the ogre's wife.

27
00:02:33.758 --> 00:02:37.360
She was standing outside the house.

28
00:02:37.361 --> 00:02:44.104
Jack took a deep breath.

29
00:02:44.105 --> 00:02:51.078
"Good morning!" he called boldly.

30
00:02:51.079 --> 00:02:53.134
"I'm very hungry.

31
00:02:53.135 --> 00:02:59.983
Can you please give me something to eat?"

